  "rationale": "1. test_exact_efficient | requirement: The output must equal the number of ships made by repeatedly cutting the largest possible square until only squares remain. | technique: Direct oracle using the efficient Euclidean algorithm sum of quotients. | oracle: output == str(expected) where expected is computed by the efficient algorithm. | validity: Holds for all inputs; the algorithm is derived from the specification.
